:: area2_start

/* Player enters the music room */
/* Gemstone is locked */

\> You enter the music room.

\> A locked box holds the gemstone.

\> In front of you, there are note buttons.

\> The puzzle begins.


\>> [[[Listen to the first sequence.|area2_level1]]]
/**********************/

/**********************/
:: area2_level1

/* First easy sequence */

\> The buttons light up in a short pattern.

\> You try to repeat it.


\>> [[[Complete level 1.|area2_level1_done]]]

\>> [[[Try again.|area2_level1]]]
/**********************/

/**********************/
:: area2_level1_done

\> Correct.

\> The first level is complete.

\> A new sequence begins.


\>> [[[Go to level 2.|area2_level2]]]
/**********************/

/**********************/
:: area2_level2

/* Second harder sequence */

\> This sequence is longer and harder.

\> You focus and repeat it carefully.


\>> [[[Complete level 2.|area2_level2_done]]]

\>> [[[Try again.|area2_level2]]]
/**********************/


/**********************/
:: area2_level2_done

-\> Correct again.

\> The box makes a clicking sound.

\> One final sequence starts.


\>> [[[Go to final level.|area2_final]]]
/**********************/

/**********************/
:: area2_final

/* Final sequence */

\> The final pattern plays.

\> It is the hardest one yet.

\> You repeat the notes.


\>> [[[Complete the final level.|area2_end]]]

\>> [[[Try again.|area2_final]]]
/**********************/


/**********************/
:: area2_end

/* Gemstone collected */

\> The box unlocks.

\> The gemstone is revealed.

\> You pick it up.


\>> [[[Go to Area 3.|area3_start]]]
/**********************/

